    Assertion:the-backup-is-also,sentence:the backup is also the upgrade queue — a smuggled lofi whose original the cave lacks queues a fetch while one already held draws none
    Assertion:only-a-cross-fidelity,sentence:only a cross-fidelity copy queues — a bare backup record with no of join is left alone since there is no original to fetch for it
    Assertion:the-queue-is-stable,sentence:the queue is stable — re-scanning an unchanged backup crate stands on the very same upgrade row and mints nothing
    Assertion:the-queue-follows-the,sentence:the queue follows the hoard — when the original arrives the upgrade drops and no stale fetch lingers
